<section begin=Intro />'''Disarm''' prevents the afflicted unit from attacking, although they can still cast abilities. When a disarmed unit is ordered to attack, they will attempt to stay within [[attack range]] of their target but will be unable to act. After the disarm's duration is over, they will resume attacking normally.<section end=Intro />

