== Patch History ==
{{PatchTableStart}}
{{PatchTableElement|2022-06-21|
* {{cf|Update|2|2022-06-21}}
** Fixed disarm from stopping the following ability's auto-attacks completely while ability is active:
*** {{A|Static Link|Razor}}
*** {{A|Focus Fire|Windranger}}
}}
{{PatchTableElement|2012-03-28|
* Added visual effect for units affected by disarm.
}}
{{PatchTableElement|2012-01-19|
* Now when attempting to cast-attack a target while hard [[disarm]]ed, the error message <code>Can't Attack</code> will appear when you reach attack range of the target.
* Fixed {{A|Disarm|Heaven's Halberd}} not disarming [[Attack modifier#Active Attack Modifiers|active attack modifiers]].
}}
{{PatchTableElement|2011-10-27|
* When disarmed, {{Key press|mouseright}}, {{Key press|A|mouseright}} or {{Key press|M}} (attack-move-click) on enemies to move toward them. The <code>Can't Attack</code> error will not appear until you reach attack range of the enemy.
}}
{{PatchTableEnd}}

